Note on third-party software:

This project does not vendor or modify ESPectre. It only invokes the ESPectre
command-line interface in a separate process (subprocess), the same way a user
would type the commands by hand. ESPectre itself is licensed under GPLv3 with a
separate commercial option, and is distributed at:

    https://github.com/francescopace/espectre

If you redistribute ESPectre itself, or build derivative firmware from it, the
terms of that project's license apply to that work, independently of this MIT
licensed wrapper.
